<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (The Sacred Monkey Forest Sanctuary is the single most-visited attraction by a wide margin \(over 13,000 visits\), and nine of the ten most-visited attractions are located in Bali, Indonesia. This indicates the dataset's attraction inventory is heavily concentrated in one destination, even though the country-level visit counts show a broader user base.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
