442 0 obj
<<
/Title (XGBoost performed best but explains only about 10% of rating variance. This indicates ratings are driven substantially by factors not captured by geography or visit timing alone, most likely individual subjective experience, service quality on the day, or attraction-specific factors not present in this feature set. Adding user-level historical behavior \(for example, a user's average past rating\) would likely improve this in a future iteration.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 414 0 R
/Prev 441 0 R
>>
endobj
